    'guide.forward.s1.title': 'What forward testing is',
    'guide.forward.s1.body': 'The in-sample is the data used to choose the parameters. The forward is a later stretch that the optimizer did not use. Since you cannot test on the future, keeping the end of your history aside simulates what would have happened if you had optimized and then traded.',
