    'home.faq.title': 'Frequently asked questions',
    'home.faq.1.q': 'Which files do I need?',
    'home.faq.1.a': 'The XML exports of your MT5 optimization: the results tab (in-sample) and, if you enabled forward, the forward tab too. The .opt file does not work. <a href="/guides/export-mt5-optimization-xml/">Step-by-step guide</a>.',
    'home.faq.2.q': 'Do I need the forward period?',
    'home.faq.2.a': 'No, but it is highly recommended. Without it, Orometra analyzes the in-sample only and the evidence cannot go beyond weak.',
    'home.faq.4.q': 'What happens to my data?',
